    <briefdescription>
<para>Utility for cloning !noalias and !alias.scope metadata. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>When a code region using scoped alias metadata is inlined, the aliasing relationships may not hold between the two version. It is necessary to create a deep clone of the metadata, putting the two versions in separate scope domains. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
